{"id":"vod_bf_1172","vodId":"1172","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"安达与岛村","name_cn":"安达与岛村","date":"2020-01-01","year":"2020","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-2/e8bf22b1593d96f7b2d5683559024d93.jpg"},"summary":"安达樱（鬼头明里 配音）是学校里公认的不良少女，常常逃课偷懒。这一天，安达照例翘掉了无聊的体育课，却在体育馆二楼遇见了同样也翘了课的岛村抱月（伊藤美来 配音）。就这样，两个本来并不是太熟的女生开始了她们的交往，两人一起聊天、打保龄球、唱卡拉OK，她们都发现对方的身上有着和自己惊人相似的个性，喜好和对事物的看法也空前的一致。　　随着时间的推移，安达发现自己的眼神总是不受控制的锁定在岛村的身上，后者的一举一动竟然能让自己脸红心跳芳心大动，安达明白，自己对岛村怀有的感情早已经超越了友谊。那么，对于两人的关系，岛村是怎么想的呢？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 16:18:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/andayudaocun/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:30:37.092Z"}